# QA M6 acceptance: the whole playable journey in one run of the real game,
# from the title through Salzburg, St. Gilgen, Brunnwinkl, Falkenstein (the
# Hackl), St. Wolfgang, the Wolfgangsee, Strobl and Bad Ischl to the Cafe
# Zauner teaser and the title, carrying the Hackl the whole way, never hurt.
# Frames 0-25577: qa_m5_accept_full_route's inputs to the start of Strobl
# play (25578, Hackl, lives 6, score 115800, 30 Oblaten).
# Strobl (clock = frame - 25578): strobl_hackl_axes's Strobl inputs (its
# frames 11927-13897: an axe on Nordic-Walker #1, the shutter staircase
# #2 -> #3 -> annex as big Resi, the Postbus halt seen from shelter B, an
# axe off the halted bus, Ampel #1 from the terrace, an axe off a car) to
# the Gastgarten terrace (27549), then a QA beam search (8-frame chunks,
# no hurt, power kept): Ampel #2, the Buergelstein walkway, the Ache, the
# Lokalbahn halt; Strobl LevelComplete at 28312 as Hackl. Idle: tally,
# route map Strobl -> Bad Ischl (Wait), no START, the Bad Ischl intro
# (29183) and play from 29333 (Hackl, lives 6, score 135450).
# Bad Ischl (clock = frame - 29333): QA beam search (8-frame chunks, no
# hurt, power kept) through the Kurgaeste, the three officer files, the
# Fiaker, the Traun notches, the Kurkapelle and the singers; an extra
# life on the 100th Oblate; Bad Ischl LevelComplete at 31188 as Hackl.
# Idle: tally, the route map Bad Ischl -> Cafe Zauner (31720) and its
# teaser, the title (31964) with the run reset to Salzburg.
# Eight LevelCompletes, no death, no hurt, all deterministic.
level  = salzburg
seed   = 1
source = handwritten
start  = title
expect = complete frames=1772..1772 deaths=0 no_event=Died no_event=Hurt no_event=GameOver event=AxeHit event=ExtraLife event=CheckpointReached event=Stroke
expect = state=title stage=salzburg power=normal score=0 lives=3 oblaten=0
